      stencil: half/bin/3d
      bin: standard
velocity all scale 1427 temp CStemp

# thermostating using the core/shell decoupling

fix thermoberendsen all temp/berendsen 1427 1427 0.4
fix nve all nve
fix_modify thermoberendsen temp CStemp

